[38;2;124;124;124mThe "Alexandrov topology" on a pre-order is the topology where open sets are [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mupper sets (or lower sets, depending on convention).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe term "pre-order topology" is somewhat ambiguous, but I think the most [0m
